{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788328050515583001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"immoderate-angelic-ibis","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"6db52b8612b4c86f57dd729f4547aa1620e04030cb8b0ef0fe930dcef472fc85","event_uuid":"570c5643-c55e-4c04-bf68-f30e174302d3","position":{"commit_sha":"5b71bde8ec499d722de572bbe86475ab2b1587ca","position":"1788317720713903001-570c5643-c55e-4c04-bf68-f30e174302d3"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"a35711bb35a2d4a9d855fbf0af92a9fed0689f8b95abce4e02742a742cf2502b","event_uuid":"d090a101-e6a5-4596-8cbf-8aa2fe7032da","position":{"commit_sha":"85a75f060f7aaccdd1129b6c540b030b5ba924ad","position":"1788317728816522001-d090a101-e6a5-4596-8cbf-8aa2fe7032da"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"514e2a881747e7d8435355c1622a6f6d8178024a64367eda4e66eca3aea012d2","event_uuid":"0704876f-e636-4b6c-a2f3-f5103ca9e9a7","position":{"commit_sha":"ddf2125c104c632d121473c7aa4731b26126123f","position":"1788318491599471001-0704876f-e636-4b6c-a2f3-f5103ca9e9a7"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788317720713903001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"d090a101-e6a5-4596-8cbf-8aa2fe7032da","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"f9b9-83ad-931c-4833"}],"description":"Mirror inventory finding F14 (reports/stability/mirror-inventory.md), LOW.\n\n- src/rebar/_cli/_registry.py:680 _CONFIRM_SCOPE (derived, canonical)\n- scripts/gen_cli_reference.py:43-46 EDITORIAL_PREAMBLE prose, emitted into docs/cli-reference.md:8\n- docs/user-guide.md:27 hand-authored, same 17 backticked names\n\nAll three agree at 17/17 today, so this is preventive. The existing gate misses both prose copies:\n_check_mutation_verbs() (gen_cli_reference.py:194-205) compares the MUTATION_VERBS dict KEYS to\n_CONFIRM_SCOPE, not the preamble; lint_editorial s route rule fires only on `rebar <verb>` forms and\nthe preamble uses bare backticks; docs/user-guide.md has no gate at all. Adding a confirmable=True\nroute updates the canonical set and the dict, and both prose copies go stale silently.\n\nProposed fix: add-parity-check — extend _check_mutation_verbs to the preamble and the user-guide list.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","f79d-0d71-0fd7-439f"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"f79d-0d71-0fd7-439f","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"0af1-44ec-0b47-4611","ticket_type":"task","title":"Gate the two prose copies of the 17 mutating verbs (mirror F14)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["570c5643-c55e-4c04-bf68-f30e174302d3","d090a101-e6a5-4596-8cbf-8aa2fe7032da","0704876f-e636-4b6c-a2f3-f5103ca9e9a7"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788328050515583001,"uuid":"3888730d-6264-49cf-b68b-bca06245db16"}